<title>USA: Southern Mineral participates in dry hole.</title>
<headline>Southern Mineral participates in dry hole.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Southern Mineral Corp said Tuesday it has a carried working interest in the Brazos Block 480L 1, an offshore exploration well operated by National Energy Group, which was plugged and abandoned.</p>
<p>Southern Mineral said the well was drilled to a depth of 13,500 feet in the shallow state waters offshore Texas. Log analysis indicates the objective sands are non-productive.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
